{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Steam_Header_Ruthless_Survival.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gescheitert auf einer geheimnisvollen Insel des 17. Jahrhunderts, die von t\u00f6dlichen Gefahren und verborgenen Geheimnissen wimmelt. Keine Hilfestellung, keine zweite Chance \u2013 nur Instinkt, Geschick und Durchhalteverm\u00f6gen. Ein erbarmungslikes Roguelike, in dem jede Entscheidung z\u00e4hlt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Gif_Seymour_800x250.gif?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Steam_Header_Dynamic_World.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eine hochgradig realistische, systemgesteuerte Welt, in der alles reagiert. Tag- und Nachtzyklen, Wetter, Feuer und Fl\u00fcssigkeiten interagieren auf komplexe Weise \u2013 und erschaffen so endlose, unvorhersehbare Herausforderungen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Gif_Coconut_pouring_800x250.gif?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Steam_Header_Progress_To_Survive.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Der Tod ist ein Fortschritt \u2013 lerne durch Handeln, passe deine Strategie an und schalte neue Gegenst\u00e4nde frei, um dein \u00dcberleben weiter voranzutreiben.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Gif_Gazebo_800x250.gif?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Steam_Header_Randomized_Session.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jeder Durchlauf ist einzigartig. Mit jeder neuen Runde werden Ressourcen, Ereignisse und Ergebnisse neu gemischt \u2013 und fordern dich heraus, zu experimentieren und bei jedem Versuch etwas Neues zu entdecken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Gif_Bat_Fight_800x250.gif?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Steam_Header_Immersive_Narrative.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Entdecke die Geschichte des \u00dcberlebenden \u2013 das Leben vor dem Schiffsbruch und die ungewisse Zukunft, die dich auf der Insel erwartet. Es muss einen Grund geben, warum du verschont wurdest \u2013 und die anderen nicht.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Gif_Starting_Scene_800x250.gif?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Steam_Header_Reviews.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/566acbac39062e097c0e9e17f4a644ad3426ff61.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cBootstrap Island is the Most Realistic VR Game I've Ever Played. Bootstrap Island blew me away. I have played a lot of VR survival games but Bootstrap Island has the best VR survival mechanics I've ever seen.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/76701dbbb0f69bd1a2b5757352b178e8347c1230.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cPCVR has been neglected for many new releases in the VR scene and now we finally got a diamond in the rough. Welcome to BOOTSTRAP ISLAND!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/3e1432d4a240193210185c6fb195be25971b22e8.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cThe Next Gen VR Survival Experience that makes you want to stay...Bootstrap Island is incredibly detailed and for the first time in actually 2 years I did not want to put my headset off.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Steam_Header_Community.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Discord_banner_image_2.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-funded by the European Union. Co-funded by European Union Creative Europe Media. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Steam_Bootstrap_Island_BW_EU_logo_2.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1942110?t=1752499914","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752499914","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/d83708594d795b1f0aa539b925657ca689f1e5fc/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_3.jpg?t=1752499914","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/d83708594d795b1f0aa539b925657ca689f1e5fc/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_3.jpg?t=1752499914","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2556320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Roadmap_Steam_overview.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Steam_Header_Ruthless_Survival.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gescheitert auf einer geheimnisvollen Insel des 17. Jahrhunderts, die von t\u00f6dlichen Gefahren und verborgenen Geheimnissen wimmelt. Keine Hilfestellung, keine zweite Chance \u2013 nur Instinkt, Geschick und Durchhalteverm\u00f6gen. Ein erbarmungslikes Roguelike, in dem jede Entscheidung z\u00e4hlt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Gif_Seymour_800x250.gif?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Steam_Header_Dynamic_World.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eine hochgradig realistische, systemgesteuerte Welt, in der alles reagiert. Tag- und Nachtzyklen, Wetter, Feuer und Fl\u00fcssigkeiten interagieren auf komplexe Weise \u2013 und erschaffen so endlose, unvorhersehbare Herausforderungen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Gif_Coconut_pouring_800x250.gif?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Steam_Header_Progress_To_Survive.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Der Tod ist ein Fortschritt \u2013 lerne durch Handeln, passe deine Strategie an und schalte neue Gegenst\u00e4nde frei, um dein \u00dcberleben weiter voranzutreiben.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Gif_Gazebo_800x250.gif?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Steam_Header_Randomized_Session.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jeder Durchlauf ist einzigartig. Mit jeder neuen Runde werden Ressourcen, Ereignisse und Ergebnisse neu gemischt \u2013 und fordern dich heraus, zu experimentieren und bei jedem Versuch etwas Neues zu entdecken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Gif_Bat_Fight_800x250.gif?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Steam_Header_Immersive_Narrative.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Entdecke die Geschichte des \u00dcberlebenden \u2013 das Leben vor dem Schiffsbruch und die ungewisse Zukunft, die dich auf der Insel erwartet. Es muss einen Grund geben, warum du verschont wurdest \u2013 und die anderen nicht.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Gif_Starting_Scene_800x250.gif?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Steam_Header_Reviews.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/566acbac39062e097c0e9e17f4a644ad3426ff61.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cBootstrap Island is the Most Realistic VR Game I've Ever Played. Bootstrap Island blew me away. I have played a lot of VR survival games but Bootstrap Island has the best VR survival mechanics I've ever seen.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/76701dbbb0f69bd1a2b5757352b178e8347c1230.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cPCVR has been neglected for many new releases in the VR scene and now we finally got a diamond in the rough. Welcome to BOOTSTRAP ISLAND!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/3e1432d4a240193210185c6fb195be25971b22e8.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cThe Next Gen VR Survival Experience that makes you want to stay...Bootstrap Island is incredibly detailed and for the first time in actually 2 years I did not want to put my headset off.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Bootstrap_Island_Steam_Header_Community.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Discord_banner_image_2.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-funded by the European Union. Co-funded by European Union Creative Europe Media. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/Steam_Bootstrap_Island_BW_EU_logo_2.png?t=1752499914\" /></div></p>","developers":["Maru VR"],"genres":[